{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10350030","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10350030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1035003001:1":{"text":"あら、今ちょうどその話をしてたのよ。","source_cn":"我们正在谈这事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8FDA4410D3A0D8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035003002:1":{"text":"イミル様がここを通りかかったの。お母さんが言うにはケガをしてたらしくてね。","source_cn":"我们看到伊米尔贤者经过这里，母亲还说，看到贤者受伤了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0940899BB500EA2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035003003:1":{"text":"それでイミル様に声をかけたんだけど、聞こえなかったのか振り向きもしなかったの……","source_cn":"可当我们呼唤贤者时，他却像是听不见……头都没歪一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C749F6BE7CD4DF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1035003004:1":{"text":"無視するなんて……いくら賢者でもあれはどうかと思うね！","source_cn":"真没礼貌……就算他是大贤者，我也很不服气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE488793804CD9BAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1035003005:1":{"text":"きっと誤解よ。ついこの前もここら辺を視察に来てくれたじゃない。そんなイミル様が無視するはずないわ。","source_cn":"不会的，贤者前阵子还在附近视察过情况，明明很关心我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B80D80F380543D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit